      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 213.90126953125002,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 11.564,
      "box_height_pt": 14.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Process Creation\n& System Calls",
      "size": 18.5,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 176.16552734375,
      "box_width_pt": 236.16000000000003,
      "required_height_pt": 43.66,
      "box_height_pt": 49.67999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Process launches, pipes and\nscheduling add work; virtualized\nI/O can add latency.",
      "size": 14.8,
      "lines": 3,
      "width_pt": 240.57949218750002,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 52.392,
      "box_height_pt": 71.28
    },
    {
      "text": "EXAMPLE",
      "size": 10.3,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 54.34658203125,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 12.154,
      "box_height_pt": 14.4
    },
    {
      "text": "An agent runs hundreds of tiny\nshell commands; launching them\ncosts more than the useful work.",
      "size": 14.0,
      "lines": 3,
      "width_pt": 232.845703125,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 49.559999999999995,
      "box_height_pt": 67.67999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Inspect: fork/exec, syscalls, context switches.",
      "size": 9.8,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 223.97880859375005,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 11.564,
      "box_height_pt": 14.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Filesystem I/O",
      "size": 18.5,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 148.424560546875,
      "box_width_pt": 236.16000000000003,
      "required_height_pt": 21.83,
      "box_height_pt": 49.67999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Many small files increase\nmetadata work; uncached reads\nand copy-on-write updates can\nadd latency.",
      "size": 14.8,
      "lines": 4,
      "width_pt": 239.994140625,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 69.856,
      "box_height_pt": 71.28
    },
    {
      "text": "EXAMPLE",
      "size": 10.3,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 54.34658203125,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 12.154,
      "box_height_pt": 14.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Installing packages and scanning a\nrepository touch thousands of\nsmall files.",
      "size": 14.0,
      "lines": 3,
      "width_pt": 246.12109375,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 49.559999999999995,
      "box_height_pt": 67.67999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Inspect: IOPS, metadata latency, cache state.",
      "size": 9.8,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 223.98837890625003,
      "box_width_pt": 248.4,
      "required_height_pt": 11.564,
      "box_height_pt": 14.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Observed in our local Code Interpreter test: first call 1,027 ms vs second 68 ms (P50; 60 pairs).",
      "size": 11.5,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 620.8203125,
      "box_width_pt": 871.1999999999999,
      "required_height_pt": 13.569999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 20.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Firecracker runs normal Linux syscalls in the guest kernel; not every syscall is intercepted by the host.",
      "size": 8.8,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 453.47929687500005,
      "box_width_pt": 869.04,
      "required_height_pt": 10.384,
