    {
      "text": "CPU Quotas & Throttling",
      "size": 18.3,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 253.19765625,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 21.594,
      "box_height_pt": 25.2
    },
    {
      "text": "With a CPU-time quota, a busy sandbox can exhaust its\nbudget and wait until the next period.",
      "size": 14.0,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 389.8330078125,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 33.04,
      "box_height_pt": 38.88
    },
    {
      "text": "EXAMPLE",
      "size": 10.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 52.763671875,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 11.799999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 12.959999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "A build stalls despite spare host cores because its own CPU\nbudget is exhausted.",
      "size": 13.2,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 392.67421875,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 31.151999999999997,
      "box_height_pt": 36.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Check: cpu.max, throttled_usec, nr_throttled.",
      "size": 10.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 227.216796875,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 11.799999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 13.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Memory Pressure",
      "size": 18.3,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 180.685693359375,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 21.594,
      "box_height_pt": 25.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Runtime state and caches grow with sandbox count.\nReclaim, allocation stalls and OOM can disrupt work.",
      "size": 14.0,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 369.099609375,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 33.04,
      "box_height_pt": 38.88
    },
    {
      "text": "EXAMPLE",
      "size": 10.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 52.763671875,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 11.799999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 12.959999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Parallel test workers exceed available RAM and are stalled\nor killed by the kernel.",
      "size": 13.2,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 387.401953125,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 31.151999999999997,
      "box_height_pt": 36.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Check: working set, memory PSI, memory.events.",
      "size": 10.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 250.2685546875,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 11.799999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 13.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Resource Contention",
      "size": 18.3,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 215.4896484375,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 21.594,
      "box_height_pt": 25.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Sandboxes share cores, caches, memory bandwidth and\nstorage; bursts can increase queueing and tail latency.",
      "size": 14.0,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 396.9150390625,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 33.04,
      "box_height_pt": 38.88
    },
    {
      "text": "EXAMPLE",
      "size": 10.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 52.763671875,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 11.799999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 12.959999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Simultaneous test runs delay other commands and can\npush new sandboxes past readiness timeouts.",
      "size": 13.2,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 366.3064453125,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 31.151999999999997,
      "box_height_pt": 36.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Check: p95/p99, queues, per-core CPU, I/O pressure.",
      "size": 10.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 264.2236328125,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 11.799999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 13.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Compatibility Limitations",
      "size": 18.3,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 260.390771484375,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 21.594,
      "box_height_pt": 25.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Restricted permissions, missing packages or kernel\nfeatures can prevent a tool from working.",
      "size": 14.0,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 360.732421875,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 33.04,
      "box_height_pt": 38.88
    },
    {
      "text": "EXAMPLE",
      "size": 10.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 52.763671875,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 11.799999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 12.959999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "A debugger needs ptrace; Docker or nested KVM may\nrequire privileges or /dev/kvm.",
      "size": 13.2,
      "lines": 2,
      "width_pt": 355.974609375,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 31.151999999999997,
      "box_height_pt": 36.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Check: required syscalls, capabilities, devices, kernels.",
      "size": 10.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 275.244140625,
      "box_width_pt": 397.44000000000005,
      "required_height_pt": 11.799999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 13.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Observed correlation: readiness timeouts coincided with CPU bursts; the causal path remains unresolved.",
      "size": 11.0,
      "lines": 1,
      "width_pt": 659.6240234375,
      "box_width_pt": 871.1999999999999,
      "required_height_pt": 12.979999999999999,
      "box_height_pt": 18.0
    },
    {
      "text": "CPU throttling and OOM were not established in this run. Swap was disabled in the tested VM.",
